# folio does not load secrets, figures, or configurable network endpoints from env.
# Never put private policy answers or financial data here.
#
# Configure these in the LOCAL OLLAMA SERVICE environment, then restart Ollama:
# OLLAMA_NO_CLOUD=1
# OLLAMA_ORIGINS=<the exact local Wealthfolio webview origin>
#
# The addon connects only to http://127.0.0.1:11434 and has no cloud fallback.
# Choose an already-installed local model in the UI; no model is downloaded by folio.
# The IPS is imported through the UI and encrypted with a passphrase, never stored here.
